      "title": "Owlet readings stopped updating",
      "description": "{name} has not sent a new reading since {last_updated}, although it is off the charger and the base station is on. Heart rate and oxygen show as unavailable until readings resume.\n\nRestarting the base station (unplug it for a few seconds) usually fixes this. This warning clears by itself when readings come back."
